  "notes": [
    "New instances inherit some global trace options; normalize only private formatting/overwrite flags.",
    "New instance buffer can record by default; disable before enabling owned events.",
    "work/function fields are pointer-valued; filters use runtime kallsyms function address.",
    "kprobe_profile columns: event name, hits, missed; unique event names avoid cross-group ambiguity.",
    "Signed s32 retval prints decimal; no instruction offsets or structure-memory fetches.",
    "boot uses fast BOOTTIME; clock reversal is rejected, no jiffies clock conversion."
  ],
